  m_Name: IntroDiaolgue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneDialogue
  lines:
  - I thought it was over.
  - The Alien Queen had destroyed everything.
  - 'But when I opened my eyes, the laboratory was different. '
  - 'I had travelled seven days before the attack. '
  - 'If I can recover the research, restore the laboratory and prepare... '
  - Maybe this time, I can stop her.
